1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,688
MIRA: You said there was milk.

2
00:00:01,918 --> 00:00:03,200
DEV: There is. I checked.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,777
MIRA: Is Jo still asleep?

4
00:00:10,027 --> 00:00:11,127
DEV: Fast asleep.

5
00:00:11,127 --> 00:00:12,191
JO: Morning!

6
00:00:12,677 --> 00:00:14,108
MIRA: Is it still raining?

7
00:00:14,308 --> 00:00:15,402
DEV: Nope. Sunny.

8
00:00:16,302 --> 00:00:17,780
DEV: It was sunny at seven.

9
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,530
That's a stale cache.

10
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:23,640
An answer saved once, and never checked again.

11
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,160
It's why a site can show you yesterday's price.

12
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,830
Good caches expire.

13
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:29,445
MIRA: Is there coffee?

14
00:00:29,445 --> 00:00:30,520
DEV: Yep. Checked.
